00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:30.520
and she is going to come back as a full awesome guest for maybe two episodes coming up, Jenna.
而且她之后会作为嘉宾完整参与接下来的两集节目，珍娜。

183
00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:31.060
Ooh.
噢。

184
00:08:31.500 --> 00:08:31.940
Ooh.
噢。

