00:08:41.360 --> 00:08:42.360
Jen, I miss you.
简，我想你了。

190
00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.540
I'm loving your podcaSt.
我超爱你们的播客。

191
00:08:43.860 --> 00:08:45.460
I am learning so much.
我学到了很多。

192
