00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:55.400
Amazing.
太棒了。

195
00:08:56.100 --> 00:09:00.100
Anyway, I'm loving it, and I'm going to answer some grief counseling questions,
总之，我很喜欢这个节目，我会回答一些关于哀伤辅导的问题，

