00:29:18.000 --> 00:29:20.820
was the caterer for it for Mindy's show, Never Have I Ever.
明迪那部剧《好想做一次》的餐饮负责人。

651
00:29:21.060 --> 00:29:22.020
He was the caterer.
他是承办宴席的人。

