A corn tortilla, poached egg, black beans, avocado, turkey bacon, Cholula on the side.
玉米饼、水煮蛋、黑豆、牛油果、火鸡培根，旁边配上Cholula辣酱。

658
00:29:40.800 --> 00:29:42.780
And I was texting with Rashida about it.
我当时还正跟拉希达发短信聊这个呢。

659
00:29:42.840 --> 00:29:45.360
She was like, I don't even know how I functioned after eating that.
她说，我真不知道吃完那个之后我是怎么正常工作的。

660
00:29:45.520 --> 00:29:47.940
Like, why should I have just gone and taken a nap?
就像是，我为什么不直接去睡一觉呢？

661
00:29:48.100 --> 00:29:49.760
But that's called the Rashida.
但那个就叫“拉希达”。

662
00:29:50.300 --> 00:29:53.060
But I can get that Angela size if I'm not that hungry.
如果我没那么饿，我可以点“安吉拉”份量的。

663
00:29:53.060 --> 00:29:55.000
Yeah, I'd like the Rashida Angela size, please.
对，请给我来一份“安吉拉”份量的“拉希达”。

664
00:29:55.540 --> 00:29:56.180
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

665
00:29:56.280 --> 00:29:57.540
That brought back so many memories.
那勾起了好多回忆。

666
00:29:58.700 --> 00:30:04.460
Molly Neck wrote in to say, guys, you can see her favorite chips in the vending machine
莫莉·内克写信来说，伙计们，你们能在自动贩卖机里看到她最喜欢的薯片，

667
00:30:04.460 --> 00:30:05.360
slot B1.
在B1槽位。

668
00:30:05.540 --> 00:30:08.340
OK, so there's a row of potato chips in the vending machine.
好的，所以自动贩卖机里有一排赫氏薯片。

669
00:30:08.380 --> 00:30:12.940
But apparently those aren't the ones that Karen wants.
但显然那些不是凯伦想要的。

670
00:30:13.180 --> 00:30:13.340
Yes.
没错。

671
00:30:13.520 --> 00:30:15.420
Karen wants salt and vinegar potato chips.
凯伦想要的是盐醋味薯片。

672
00:30:15.420 --> 00:30:21.840
I did a mini deep dive on hers potato chips and Philadelphia Magazine did a ranking of
我专门深入研究了一下赫氏薯片，费城杂志对所有的赫氏薯片做了一个排名，

673
00:30:21.840 --> 00:30:25.660
all the hers potato chips and salt and vinegar was their number one chip.
盐醋味是他们排名第一的薯片。

674
00:30:26.480 --> 00:30:30.980
So it might make sense that it was hard to find because it's their it's the number one
所以它很难找也说得通，因为它是他们的，它是排名第一的

675
00:30:30.980 --> 00:30:31.320
chip.
薯片。

676
00:30:31.940 --> 00:30:34.160
Close behind was cheddar horseradish.
紧随其后的是切达干酪辣根味。

677
00:30:34.940 --> 00:30:37.500
Pam's favorite sour cream and onion was number four.
帕姆最喜欢的酸奶油洋葱味排在第四。

678
00:30:38.060 --> 00:30:40.160
Our favorite is their barbecue chips.
我们最喜欢的是他们的烧烤味薯片。

679
00:30:40.400 --> 00:30:42.120
I love their hers barbecue chips.
我超爱他们的赫氏烧烤味薯片。

680
00:30:42.320 --> 00:30:44.160
I don't know where that is in the ranking.
我不知道那个在排名里排第几。

681
00:30:44.900 --> 00:30:45.680
OK, I'm sorry.
好吧，抱歉。

682
00:30:45.800 --> 00:30:46.760
I didn't look that one up.
我没查那个。

683
00:30:46.900 --> 00:30:50.740
OK, but I do have a script catch for you as well.
好的，但我也有一个剧本发现要告诉你。

684
00:30:50.940 --> 00:30:52.740
We're not done talking about this yet.
我们还没聊完这个呢。

685
00:30:52.740 --> 00:30:57.740
In the shooting draft of the script, her favorite chips were going to be salsa verde
在剧本的拍摄初稿中，她最喜欢的薯片本来是青柠味

