00:31:01.540 --> 00:31:06.240
We're going back to Scranton and Creed is in Michael's office with Dwight and Michael.
我们要回到斯克兰顿，克里德在迈克尔的办公室里，和德怀特还有迈克尔在一起。

690
00:31:06.240 --> 00:31:10.640
And he tells them that Ed was decapitated.
他告诉他们埃德被斩首了。

691
00:31:11.800 --> 00:31:13.440
And Michael's like, what?
迈克尔说，什么？

692
00:31:13.600 --> 00:31:15.560
And he goes, yeah, he was flying down the road.
他说，对，他当时在路上飞驰。

693
00:31:15.560 --> 00:31:16.280
He'd been drinking.
他喝了酒。

694
00:31:16.880 --> 00:31:19.260
And I guess he ran into a semi truck, right?
我想他撞上了一辆半挂卡车，对吧？

695
00:31:19.420 --> 00:31:20.200
And was decapitated.
然后就被斩首了。

696
00:31:20.580 --> 00:31:24.200
Angela, we got a lot of mail about this scene with Creed.
安吉拉，我们收到了很多关于克里德这场戏的来信。

697
00:31:24.820 --> 00:31:32.000
OK, there is a very, very big debate online over whether or not Creed, the character, is
好的，网上有一个非常、非常大的争论，关于克里德这个角色

698
00:31:32.000 --> 00:31:37.580
making it up that Ed was decapitated or if it's the truth, the truth within the show.
说的埃德被斩首这件事到底是他在编故事，还是事实，剧中的事实。

699
00:31:37.760 --> 00:31:41.800
And, you know, Creed told some crazy stories, both on camera and off camera.
而且，你知道，克里德讲过很多疯狂的故事，无论是在镜头前还是镜头后。

700
00:31:41.900 --> 00:31:47.580
So I can see where this sort of like controversy, if you will, around Creed's retelling of this.
所以我能理解为什么围绕克里德的复述会有这种争议。

701
00:31:47.620 --> 00:31:48.060
Is it true?
是真的吗？

702
00:31:48.200 --> 00:31:48.600
Is it not?
难道不是吗？

703
00:31:49.020 --> 00:31:53.580
Fiona, Danielle, Kelly, Danny, Mackenzie, Adam and Valerie.
菲奥娜、丹妮尔、凯利、丹尼、麦肯齐、亚当和瓦莱丽。

704
00:31:53.580 --> 00:32:00.960
They all said, how did Creed know the details of Ed Truck's death if Michael was the first to know from corporate?
他们都在问，如果迈克尔是第一个从公司得知消息的人，克里德是怎么知道埃德·特拉克死亡细节的？

705
00:32:01.420 --> 00:32:07.320
So their theory is that Creed's making it up because there's no possible way for him to know more details than Michael.
所以他们的理论是，克里德在编故事，因为他根本不可能比迈克尔知道更多的细节。

706
00:32:08.500 --> 00:32:15.800
And then Maria pointed out that Creed lies later in another episode and says that Dwight was decapitated.
然后玛丽亚指出，克里德在另一集里撒谎说德怀特被斩首了。

707
00:32:16.120 --> 00:32:17.780
That's in the episode, The Return.
那是《回归》那一集。

708
00:32:18.040 --> 00:32:24.080
So she's like, maybe Creed is just obsessed with decapitation because he's a weird character.
所以她的意思是，也许克里德只是对斩首有执念，因为他是个怪人。

709
00:32:24.960 --> 00:32:25.900
I don't know.
我不知道。

710
00:32:26.460 --> 00:32:27.560
Well, here's the thing.
嗯，情况是这样的。

711
00:32:27.840 --> 00:32:30.860
I love that you guys were all writing back and forth about this.
我很高兴你们大家都在为此来回讨论。

712
00:32:30.980 --> 00:32:35.920
I think that because Creed knew Ed, he actually knew Ed, maybe there was someone he called.
我认为因为克里德认识埃德，他确实认识埃德，也许他给某个人打了电话。

713
00:32:35.920 --> 00:32:40.220
But we decided, hey, let's go to the source.
但我们决定，嘿，让我们去问问源头。

714
00:32:40.500 --> 00:32:41.800
Let's ask Jen Salata.
让我们问问简·萨拉塔。

715
00:32:41.920 --> 00:32:47.820
Was this story made up by Creed, the character, or was it truth in the sort of scope of the show?
这个故事是角色克里德编出来的，还是在剧集设定的范围内确有其事？

716
00:32:47.940 --> 00:32:48.940
Did this really happen?
这真的发生了吗？

717
00:32:49.200 --> 00:32:50.780
So here's what Jen had to say.
简是这么说的。

718
00:32:51.280 --> 00:32:53.880
Did Ed Truck really get decapitated?
埃德·特拉克真的被斩首了吗？

719
00:32:54.260 --> 00:32:57.680
Sadly for Ed Truck, he did really get decapitated.
埃德·特拉克很不幸，他确实被斩首了。

720
00:32:58.120 --> 00:33:04.300
It sounds like a Creed story, but it actually was a true story in the world of our show.
这听起来像是个克里德式的故事，但在我们剧集的世界里，它确实是个真实的故事。

721
00:33:04.300 --> 00:33:06.520
There was no Ed Truck and he didn't really lose his head.
现实中没有埃德·特拉克这个人，他也没有真的丢掉脑袋。

722
00:33:06.660 --> 00:33:10.760
However, in the world of The Office, he did get decapitated for real.
然而，在《办公室》的世界里，他确实被斩首了。

723
00:33:12.180 --> 00:33:15.100
I think it was Greg that came up with the decapitation.
我想是格雷格想出了斩首这个点子。

724
00:33:15.100 --> 00:33:17.340
I can't quite remember and Greg can't remember.
我记不太清了，格雷格也记不清了。

725
00:33:17.340 --> 00:33:34.220
But I remember spending a lot of time talking about the way Michael's former boss would die and how it had to be something very sudden and jarring so that it could be a shock to Michael Scott's system that he could just freak out one day because he's just living his life and going into the office.
但我记得我们花了很多时间讨论迈克尔的前老板会以什么方式去世，而且必须是非常突然和令人震惊的方式，这样才能给迈克尔·斯科特带来冲击，让他某天突然崩溃，因为他原本只是在过着自己的生活，照常去办公室上班。

726
00:33:34.360 --> 00:33:35.720
And then all of a sudden he could be dead.
然后突然之间，人就没了。

727
00:33:35.720 --> 00:33:40.900
So I think that is where the decapitation came from.
所以我认为斩首这个点子就是这么来的。

728
00:33:41.040 --> 00:33:45.480
Unfortunately, I also can't remember who came up with his kappas decapitated from his head.
不幸的是，我也记不起是谁想出了他被斩首的细节。

729
00:33:45.620 --> 00:33:50.480
I feel like it wasn't me because I would have been really proud of it if it was me and I'd remember that.
我觉得应该不是我，因为如果是我想出来的，我会引以为傲，肯定会记得的。

730
00:33:50.700 --> 00:33:54.580
But yeah, the decapitation was real for Ed Truck.
但没错，对于埃德·特拉克来说，斩首是真的。

731
00:33:54.820 --> 00:33:55.620
Sorry, Ed Truck.
抱歉了，埃德·特拉克。

732
00:33:56.160 --> 00:33:57.240
There you have it.
事情就是这样。

733
00:33:57.340 --> 00:33:59.260
Ed Truck really got decapitated.
埃德·特拉克真的被斩首了。

734
00:33:59.740 --> 00:34:03.100
Creed actually got some facts that Michael didn't know.
克里德确实掌握了一些迈克尔不知道的事实。

735
00:34:03.100 --> 00:34:06.700
This is the slippery slope with Creed.
这就是克里德让人捉摸不透的地方。

736
00:34:06.900 --> 00:34:10.120
And let me tell you, this is true in real life and as his character.
我跟你说，无论是在现实生活中还是作为角色，这都是真的。

737
00:34:10.360 --> 00:34:12.900
He'll say something and you're like, that's not true.
他会说些什么，你会觉得，那不是真的。

738
00:34:13.040 --> 00:34:14.620
And then it's 100% true.
结果却是百分之百真实。

739
00:34:14.820 --> 00:34:17.260
And then he'll say something else and it's total BS.
然后他又会说些别的，结果全是胡扯。

740
00:34:17.960 --> 00:34:20.060
So welcome to the world of Creed.
所以，欢迎来到克里德的世界。

