justifying why is he shoving this bird into a can.
为他为什么要往罐子里塞那只鸟做辩解。

1575
01:10:50.820 --> 01:10:53.740
And it's because he grew up on a farm.
因为他在农场长大。

1576
01:10:53.960 --> 01:10:54.100
Yeah.
是啊。

1577
01:10:54.100 --> 01:10:58.480
And guys, they reburied his grandfather in an old oil drum.
伙计们，他们把他爷爷重新埋进了一个旧油桶里。

1578
01:11:00.460 --> 01:11:01.540
OK, hold on.
等等，等一下。

1579
01:11:01.660 --> 01:11:06.120
I mean, the same the same grandfather that was buried in the suit that he wore.
我是说，就是那个穿着他穿过的西装下葬的爷爷。

1580
01:11:06.320 --> 01:11:07.020
Like, what's happening?
这到底是怎么回事？

1581
01:11:07.140 --> 01:11:09.340
How many times has this guy been brought up out of the ground?
这家伙到底被从地里挖出来多少次了？

1582
