我们对此不再多言。

1606
01:11:55.120 --> 01:11:59.400
And then three episodes later, he's like, when my grandfather was reburied.
然后三集之后，他又说，当他祖父改葬的时候。

1607
01:12:00.220 --> 01:12:02.920
And it's like, slowly, it's all coming together.
就像是，慢慢地，一切都串联起来了。

1608
01:12:03.780 --> 01:12:04.460
Sort of.
算是吧。

1609
01:12:04.620 --> 01:12:05.060
Sort of.
算是吧。

1610
01:12:05.120 --> 01:12:05.740
Not completely.
也不完全是。

1611
01:12:06.240 --> 01:12:08.940
It's one of my favorite bits of how our show is written.
这是我们剧本创作中我最喜欢的部分之一。

