躺在上面。

1639
01:13:16.620 --> 01:13:21.600
And the outside is decorated in tissue paper and has a tiny little toothpick cross.
外面用棉纸装饰，还有一个小小的牙签十字架。

1640
01:13:22.080 --> 01:13:24.060
My favorite part are the...
我最喜欢的部分是……

1641
01:13:24.060 --> 01:13:24.940
The handles.
把手。

1642
01:13:24.940 --> 01:13:28.240
The handles made out of the pencils.
用铅笔做的把手。

1643
01:13:28.640 --> 01:13:30.180
So that was a Phil addition.
那是菲尔额外加的。

1644
01:13:30.580 --> 01:13:32.080
That was just Phil.
那完全是菲尔的主意。

1645
01:13:32.440 --> 01:13:32.720
Yeah.
是的。

1646
01:13:33.060 --> 01:13:33.300
Yeah.
是的。

1647
01:13:33.520 --> 01:13:39.960
He needed to make sure that tiny bird casket had little bars for the pallbearers.
他得确保那个小鸟棺材有供抬棺人抓握的小杆子。

1648
01:13:40.420 --> 01:13:41.220
That's right.
没错。

1649
01:13:41.480 --> 01:13:43.160
The tiny pallbearers.
小小的抬棺人。

1650
01:13:43.280 --> 01:13:43.680
Yes.
