1661
01:14:11.060 --> 01:14:14.140
D-Temp said, I feel kind of weird about Jim and Karen.
D-Temp说，我对吉姆和凯伦的事感觉有点怪怪的。

1662
01:14:14.980 --> 01:14:17.740
But Hartman said, the Karen thing?
但Hartman说，凯伦那件事？

1663
01:14:17.980 --> 01:14:19.860
Why am I liking it?
为什么我竟然觉得还行？

1664
01:14:19.940 --> 01:14:20.680
But I am.
但我确实觉得还行。

1665
01:14:21.080 --> 01:14:21.340
Whoa.
哇哦。

1666
01:14:22.040 --> 01:14:24.520
I remember people freaking out about it.
我记得当时人们对此反应非常激烈。

1667
01:14:25.440 --> 01:14:28.740
Well, Keeley said, Jim and Karen have great chemistry.
嗯，Keeley说，吉姆和凯伦很有化学反应。

1668
01:14:29.500 --> 01:14:31.800
